metadata.prompt:
Pixar-style narrative emotional arc soundtrack, 55 seconds.
"Enemy becomes food" revelation theme.
Similar to Ratatouille Anton Ego flashback meets Inside Out core memory.

Instruments: solo piano (intimate moments), warm string ensemble 
(revelation swells), harp arpeggios (curiosity), marimba (anger pulse), 
celesta (epiphany sparkles), light woodwinds (eating joy).

Tempo: 4/4 march 100 BPM warrior approach (0-12s), 
4/4 slow 70 BPM cautious investigation (12-25s), 
4/4 rubato emotional revelation (25-35s), 
4/4 happy 130 BPM joyful eating (35-50s), 
4/4 slow 60 BPM contemplation (50-55s).

Structure:
0-7s marching warrior theme marimba + low brass villain motif callback;
7-12s two sharp pizzicato KA-KA hits (pecking shell) + tense strings;
12-20s curiosity harp arpeggios + tentative piano + questioning woodwinds;
20-28s BUILD UP strings tremolo crescendo + harp glissando + celesta;
28-32s SUDDEN SILENCE then SINGLE PIANO NOTE (taste-test moment);
32-37s REVELATION EXPLOSION full orchestra major key bloom OMG IT'S FOOD;
37-50s joyful eating fast piccolo + marimba + bouncy strings;
50-55s ritardando + quiet sustained string note + contemplative fade.

Optional ethereal OHH at 32-35s for revelation magic.
Instrumental only, no lyrics.

