metadata.prompt:
Pixar-style comedic action soundtrack, 40 seconds.
Slapstick cartoon comedy music, Tom & Jerry orchestral meets Pixar warmth.

Instruments: comedic brass (tuba wah-wah, trombone slides), 
timpani drums for impact hits, orchestral strings tension, 
xylophone comedic accents, low bassoon for confused tone.

Tempo: starts 100 BPM slapstick, speeds up to 130 BPM rage chase.

Mood: cartoon physical comedy "getting bonked on head" humor, 
escalating frustration into burning rage, ends with battle determination.

Structure:
0-5s timpani BOOM hit + brass wah-wah comedic fail + confused bassoon;
5-12s second BOOM + escalating string tremolo + xylophone confusion;
12-20s third BOOM + full orchestral hit + dizzy descending strings;
20-28s slow rebuild low strings tremolo + plucked bass revenge pulse;
28-35s battle drums DUM DUM DUM enter, brass fanfare builds;
35-40s sustained tension chord with snare roll, cliffhanger ending.

Instrumental only, no vocals.

